# gf180mcu_fd_sc_mcu9t5v0 ships no drc_exclude.cells, while its 7-track
# sibling does. OpenLane resolves PNR_EXCLUDED_CELL_FILE to that path
# unconditionally and refuses to start when it is absent, so the 9-track
# library cannot be used at all without supplying one.
#
# Empty on purpose: this asserts nothing about which 9-track cells are
# DRC-clean. It only says the file exists. If a licon-style rule turns up
# the way it did for sky130_fd_sc_hs, the offending cells belong here and
# the evidence belongs in the case.
